b. maintaining and developing FPKK in prevention, services, and empowerment of Women Victims and Child Victims in a networked manner and referral system;
c. conducting education on the values of non-Discrimination, non-Violence, non-Exploitation, non-Wrongdoing Against Children and/or neglect towards women and children;
